WEBVTT

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.360
Man, I'm beat.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.940
We'll grab some grub after
I change, Young Master.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:13.830
My Yuka-tan posters!

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:14.840
My Yuka-tan tapestries!

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.130
My Yuka-tan body pillow cover!

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.120
My Yuka-tan CDs!

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.110
My Yuka-tan DVDs and Blu-rays!

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.450
My scrapbook of Yuka-tan articles!

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.850
Yep, burned 'em up

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.340
in the school's incinerator.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.260
Asdfghjkl!11!1!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.420
Numskull!

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:37.760
You got no qualms 'bout Kinoshita-san seein' yer creepy collection?

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.680
I done did it for yer own good.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:46.700
Yer ma asked me to look after you,
so I couldn't leave you be.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.060
Well, granted...

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.320
Darn tootin'.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.200
And don't <i>you</i> try no hanky-panky
with that gal while <i>I'm</i> alive and kickin'!

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:57.680
I betcha she came here all full up of ideas

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:02.220
from Tasha Tudoia 'bout
idyllic country gardenin' and other gobbledygook.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.290
Nah, come on.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.370
I'm tellin' you it's the truth!

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:08.920
She's havin' her first practical class tomorrer, ain't she?

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:09.890
Oh, yeah.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.060
Then that's when I'll find out what she's really made of.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:15.220
What's this?

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:19.990
My childhood friend and my most worshipped idol
are gonna lock horns under one roof?

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:23.470
It sounds like some moé-pandering light novel,
but for me, it's reality!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:06.240
Well, I'm impressed she didn't hightail it.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.120
No duh. To her, this is just class.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:13.750
Man, why did Kei have to have welding class <i>now</i> of all times?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.580
My body is ready!

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.970
I dunno if I can handle being the sole voice of reason.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.220
That was quick.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.430
Didja change into the
work clothes I gave you?

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.100
Of course.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.100
Wha—M-Minori! What gives?

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.880
In what universe are those "work clothes"?!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.120
Golly, I musta mixed 'em up.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:44.280
What unholy sequence of events led you
to confuse work clothes with <i>bikini armor</i>?!

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.200
Don't you think this
hazing's a bit <i>too</i> blatant?

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.620
I-I ain't hazin' her!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.250
Don't "hmph" me!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.360
I'm testin' her ability to work
without gettin' distracted by her getup.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:57.040
A gal who fusses over her looks ain't got no place in the fields.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.420
Then normal work clothes would have done the job!

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.980
Bikini armor is a whole
new level of stupid!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.180
It's not bad.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.220
Fine then. I get it.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.140
Will you be happy if I change too?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:12.680
How's this?

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.350
High-leg armor!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.830
Down, boy.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.700
Kousaku, you're looking at us dirty.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.950
Th-That's not it, Ringo!

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:39.140
If you're too yaller,
feel free to chicken out.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.050
I won't.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.590
I expected as much.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.420
P-Paladin!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.020
I mean, Kei.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.960
What's with the suit?

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:51.860
What happened to your welding training?

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.920
I left to check up on you three.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.060
Allow me to join your party for a bit.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.530
This is the cucumber greenhouse.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.020
It's Kinoshita-san!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.240
Gotta love that
slender bod!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.230
Looks like the
other one's Nakazawa.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.700
Can't complain, that's for sure.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.080
Our task is simple.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:17.710
We just gotta check the leaves for disease or nasty bugs.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.420
Kinoshita-san, you're on that side.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.250
I'll handle this'un.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.940
We'll go on the signal.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.640
You start us off, Kousaku.

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:25.780
Huh? Me?

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:26.500
Yes, you!

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.430
If you ain't gonna do it, who will?

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.260
Fine. Ready, start.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.220
And they're off in costume!

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:38.140
Minori clearly has no intention to play nice.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:43.070
It's true that cucumbers are easy to grow and thus recommended for beginners.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.740
However, their leaves and stalks
are dense with needle-like protrusions

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:48.640
which prick when you come
in contact with them.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.700
You mean the bikini armor
was all part of the plan?!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:56.560
Minori was sown and grown in the fields, while Kinoshita was raised in the city.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.040
The latter is at a clear
disadvantage in this task.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:00.920
She's fast!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.180
There's no contest!

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:04.420
Class A's Nakazawa Minori is a machine!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.220
Is the match as good as done?

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.640
No! Minori won't stop till her opponent begs for mercy!

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.510
That's right! The pricks aren't the only challenge!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.850
Can Ringo stand her ground when she encounters that feared abomination?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:19.920
You mean <i>that</i>?

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:22.230
That which even the bravest
veterans have faltered before?

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.400
Well, looky what you found there!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.160
Curses! The dreaded beast appears!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:35.040
Go on! See them cucumber pests and bawl yer eyes out!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:39.660
Scream, "I'm quitting this school!" and skedaddle on back to Tokyo!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.460
Inconceivable!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.090
Did she invoke the Cryme Catalyst
without an <i>Oratorio di Convocazione</i>?!

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.300
Is this the power
the bikini armor holds?

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.440
O-Of course!

00:06:56.440 --> 00:07:00.880
Having been raised in a sterile plot,
she never learned to detest vermin!

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.860
Such innocence! Such a pure soul!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.180
Look!

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.070
Nakazawa's huge lead
is shrinking as we speak!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.570
I ain't gonna lose at <i>my</i> school over <i>my</i> childhood friend!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:12.530
Flip!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:13.370
Flip!

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.620
Flip! Flip! Flip!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.080
Flip!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:20.980
Who was it?

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.120
It looked like Nakazawa by a hair...

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.000
Bag.

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:37.140
I'll be nice and call the cucumber match a draw.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.720
Next stop's the henhouse!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:44.400
Namely, the coop!

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:49.860
Coop cleaning is one of the big two
first-year practicals, next to rice planting.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.900
The first challenge of working in the chicken coop is naturally...

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.940
the smell!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:04.620
As chickens prefer dim light,
they're generally raised in enclosed spaces.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.790
Enclosed—ergo bad circulation.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.590
The smell, heat, and humidity have nowhere to escape.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:13.930
Next, we'll compete in
sweepin' the floor in here.

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.140
Brush away the droppin's, feathers,
and chicken feed till it's clean as a hound's tooth!

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:21.520
If you don't like it, better hightail it back to Tokyo with yer tail between yer legs.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.600
Has she adapted to
this environment already?

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.570
Not so fast! We can't
breathe a sigh of relief yet!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.460
Precisely!

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.950
The stench is but the first circle of Hell!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:39.450
You can adapt to the smell
and endure the heat, but there's <i>them</i>...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.160
The real Hell is about to begin!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:47.500
Golly, Kinoshita-san, you hain't done behind these doors yet.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.080
Are you just gonna leave
the feed storeroom be?

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:03.600
Why are these guys always so frisky?!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.560
Dim light, moisture, warmth, and a chicken-feed buffet!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.400
For them, this is Eden!

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:13.360
Kinoshita-san, make sure you
take care of our roachy friends!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.570
I'll gladly help if'n you admit defeat!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.180
Sh-She's stomping the roaches!

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:32.900
This work contains scenes of cruelty. Viewer discretion is advised!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:36.020
Hey! Ain't you 'fraid of cockroaches?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:36.970
Not really.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.100
All finished.

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:49.040
Won by: Ringo Kinoshita!

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:50.970
Victory.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:51.840
N-Not yet!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.160
'Tain't over yet!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.570
Just give up, Minori.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:58.820
Th-The last round'll be the bread and butter of agriculture—the rice paddy!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:00.910
Rice paddy?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:01.730
Darn tootin'!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:05.330
Rice has been central to Japanese life
since the Yayoi period.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.900
You ain't Japanese
if you don't eat rice!

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.830
Nothin' soothes the Japanese soul like the sight of fields lush with rice!

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.920
The rice plants all
a-droopin' with the harvest!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.020
If you can't hold yer own in
the paddies, get outta Japan!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.480
So the gloves are off.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.280
Okay, I have <i>no</i> idea what you just said.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.640
I ain't said nothin' but the truth!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:21.730
So what'll it be?

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.810
If you're too yaller,
now's the time to run!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.600
I won't.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:25.890
You got guts.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.820
Fine. Saturday in the paddies then.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:33.780
Come in clothes you
don't mind getting wet.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.070
Cut to commercial.

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.250
This paddy is a tenth of a hectare.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:40.580
One thousand square meters.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:43.490
Even with four people,
it could easily take half the day.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:47.270
Time for a rice plantin' hoedown!

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:50.710
First, I'd like to make sure of something.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:55.480
Now granted, wearing clothes you don't mind getting wet is rice planting 101.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.920
But I feel like you guys
have taken that to, well,

00:10:58.920 --> 00:10:59.920
the <i>illogical</i> extreme.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.480
Are these clothes wrong?

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.190
Not at all!

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:06.050
That tracksuit is perfect, Ringo. Good job!

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.840
In fact, it's adorable!

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:09.390
But <i>you</i>, Four-eyes!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.230
What's wrong?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.490
What <i>isn't</i>?

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:12.900
In fact, what's wrong with <i>you</i>?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.730
What possessed you to come
rice planting in <i>bikini briefs</i>?

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.440
Sure, it's okay if they get wet.
They're briefs.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.790
But they're <i>not</i> okay
in every other sense!

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:21.440
Exterminate!

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.640
That's odd.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.370
It was a big hit at work.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:25.950
At work?!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.450
What kind of job <i>is</i> this?

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:31.160
Let's just say I deal with
the price of housing.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.150
So you're a rent-boy!

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:35.290
Our establishment is called "Guy Fawkers".

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.880
Did you turn a British revolutionary into a homosexual pun?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.970
Behold, the prodigy of Tamo Agricultural, Kamatori Kei!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.750
He does things we never could without batting an eye!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.850
That's what's so electrifying and inspiring about him!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:50.390
Even so, I'm not sure
that getup's appropriate.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.430
You're not with your clients today.

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.600
Ringo and the other girls are here.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.590
Abdominals and thighs!

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.820
We get it, you're ripped!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.450
But fine, whatever!

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.780
You! Forty-year-old virgin!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:03.590
Yes?

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.870
We're here to <i>farm</i>.
You teach at a <i>farming school</i>.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.110
So why are you in a <i>dress</i>?

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.710
Are you fine with getting dirty?

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.610
Yes.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:13.120
Defile Becky from head to toe~

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:15.330
Dear Lord, censor yourself!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:18.150
It's all right, Hata-kun. Becky's willing.

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.970
Do anything you want with her.

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:22.300
She came here ready to get <i>dirty</i>!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.760
Okay, I'm sorry. That's disgusting. Please go home.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.790
Becky doesn't mind staying all night.

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.330
Go home, <i>please</i>.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.200
I assure you we'll be done by evening.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:33.390
Now, don't tell me you'll
be satisfied after just <i>once</i>.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.770
Don't give me that
"have some fun, Boy Scout" look!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.360
How many fields do you
want me to plant today?!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.490
Plant your seed in Becky's field, and do it raw!

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:47.870
Go cram yer teachin'
certificate in a shredder!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.120
Have some self control, you randy cougar!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.410
Thanks, Minori. I owe you one for that.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:57.080
Shucks, anythin' for you, Kou-tan.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.370
Minori, what are those?

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:03.260
Bloomers.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.220
Say—

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.300
what?!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.610
<i>O how blue,</i>

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:14.370
<i>bluer yet than these skies of azure,</i>

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:15.550
<i>these bloomers are.</i>

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.980
I mean, not that I'm complaining,

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.070
but why bloomers?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.190
Our school's gym uniform has shorts.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.150
I asked my folks to send 'em
for the occasion.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:28.290
Just for today?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.540
I must say, bloomers are a
rare sight in this day and age.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.490
I thought they'd gone extinct.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:36.370
Well, this pair used to be my big sis's.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.230
Whoa there, Minori,
what are you doing?!

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.920
It was ridin' up, so I fixed it.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.800
Did you fall out of
the stupid tree?!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.110
Be it school swimsuits,
bloomers, or leotards,

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:49.770
that action has turned men into beasts since time immemorial!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.270
Minori, you idiot!

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.060
Bloomer seductress!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:56.650
W-Well 'tain't my fault
you was starin' at me!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:57.270
Perv!

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:58.570
Was not!

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.810
I was staring at your <i>bloomers</i>!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.730
That ain't no different!

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.280
Wha—Kinoshita-san,
what are you doin'?!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.910
A-A school swimsuit?!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.490
No doubt about it, this is a school swimsuit.

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:18.160
What's more, it's a classic SS!

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.600
Classic SS?

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.750
Allow me to explain.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:24.660
"Classic SS" stands for classic-style school swimsuit.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.340
Its most distinguishing feature

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.020
is the division of the crotch region into upper and lower parts.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:31.470
As for why this style of
swimsuit was adopted,

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.600
some say it improves the elasticity

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.600
while others suggest it prevents water
from accumulating inside the swimsuit.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:41.570
Either way, its unique design has
made it an especially popular model.

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:44.570
Wow, you're quite the experts.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.740
But I like it that way.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.560
Simple and classic—how a girl should be.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.910
I have no idea what I'm even saying.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.720
Don't stare.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:54.780
S-Sorry!

00:14:55.110 --> 00:15:00.410
Y-You looked so cute in that swimsuit
I couldn't take my eyes away.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.380
S-Stupid.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.380
I'm really sorry! I'll stop looking!

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:07.630
You dunce!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.210
Now, now, you two.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:19.880
I dunno what's got you so angry,

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:22.480
but even the Landscaping guys are watching us, so tone it down...

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:23.860
Why should we?!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.800
You know, we've got planting to do,

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:31.360
so if you could stop the balloon wars
and leave your grudges outside the paddy...

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.960
If you say so, Kousaku.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:44.500
Then without further ado,
into the paddy we go!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.360
The mud tends to seep between your toes.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.640
Once you get used to it,
it actually feels nice.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.100
O-Okay...

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.850
All right. First, I'll demonstrate how it's done.

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:06.110
Amazing, Kousaku.

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.190
Y-You think so?

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:10.780
Oh, there's no doubt Kousaku's remarkable.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:13.110
As far as practical skills goes,

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.200
his rice-planting ability
likely exceeds the instructors'.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:19.910
Yeah. They used to call me "Mud Man" back home.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.120
All right, Ringo, now you try.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.870
Now hold it!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.790
We're fixin' to have a plantin' contest today.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.970
You can't be mollycoddlin' her like this.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:32.630
No, this is only fair.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.600
You have significantly
more experience than her.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.320
Does she not deserve
to learn at least the basics?

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.360
Well, if Kei says so, 'tain't my place to argue.

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:43.780
But make it snappy.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:44.440
Right, right.

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:47.360
Try doing it like I showed you.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:47.900
'Kay.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.040
You have to push the roots more firmly into the mud.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.780
Otherwise, it'll lose its grip
and float to the top later.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.180
Like this?

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:57.950
Harder!

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:00.940
Watch.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:02.660
You gotta shove it in hard,

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.660
then sort of press the mud into place around it.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:06.360
Got it?

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:07.900
It's hard to see through the mud.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:08.860
Oh, right.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:11.340
If she can't learn, you might as well give up!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:16.470
C'mon, let's get goin' with the contest
before Becky gets another year older!

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.090
...so cold, you know?

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.720
Kousaku, why don't you
and her do it together?

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.240
You know, the classic hands-on approach.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:28.460
But w-wouldn't that not perhaps cause our b-b-bodies to touch maybe perchance?

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.940
Hey! Why does <i>she</i> get a "private lesson"?!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:37.340
But Minori, surely beating a clearly disadvantaged opponent would be a hollow victory.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:42.900
Th-That's true, but their
b-b-bodies would t-t-touch...

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.250
Kinoshita, have you any objections?

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.120
No.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:49.280
Wait, seriously?

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.750
You won't sue me afterward or anything?

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:52.210
Yes.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:56.050
Y-Yes as in you will not? So no?

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.800
But screw it! Here I go!

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.180
Ready?

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.350
So first...

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.680
Shucks, sorry!

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:13.100
My foot done got stuck in the mud!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:18.490
Golly, Kousaku, I'd be mightily obliged if you'd teach me how to walk in mud.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.870
All right, lecture over.
Let the contest begin.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:22.950
What gives?!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.140
Okay.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.650
As a beginner, Kinoshita-san will start from there.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:34.380
As an expert, Nakazawa-san will start from behind.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.780
Some battles in life
you can't afford to lose.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.120
The Tamo High
Rice Planting Cup.

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:40.400
Play-by-play will be provided
by me, Kamatori Kei.

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:42.720
We are joined by analyst
Hata Kousaku-san.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.350
It's a pleasure to
be here today.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:46.960
Now to our referee, Becky.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.690
Ready...

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.020
BLAM!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:56.780
Talk about a strong start!

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:03.680
We've come to expect this
performance from Nakazawa.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:05.670
However, can she
keep up the pace?

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:08.960
Yes, that's key. Well, she's
known for her stamina.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.660
I'm sure closing in to put pressure on her opponent is part of her strategy.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:13.560
I see.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.910
Let's pay attention here
to Kinoshita's handling.

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:18.870
Is she going to succumb to
the pressure and seal her own fate?

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:19.660
No, look closer!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:20.630
Look at that line!

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:22.960
It's straight as a ruler!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:27.100
Kinoshita putting on a remarkable show of mental fortitude.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.580
But man...

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:33.410
Is this not a vision from Heaven, comrades?

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.760
What do you mean?

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:38.630
Throughout history, tits men
and ass men have battled it out!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.360
"Tits lovers have
Oedipus complexes!"

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.180
"Ass lovers are just pervs," they said!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.720
And so we've been embroiled
in a brutal and endless civil war!

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:45.460
That's true!

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:47.590
But gaze upon the scene before us!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.410
Bloomers!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.540
Swimsuit!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:51.410
Bloomers!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.290
Swimsuit!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:56.480
Is now not the time to join hands and move forward together?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.210
And here comes Nakazawa!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.220
She's already drawn even with Kinoshita!

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:04.880
Whadya lookin' at, gal?

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:05.930
Nothing.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:11.280
You ain't never gonna be a <i>real</i>
agricultural student in my eyes, you hear?

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.140
Fine by me.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.160
Really, now?

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.310
Then you won't miss your lead!

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:26.530
Sorry.

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.480
Shucks, don't pay it no mind!

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.580
Accidents happen!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.120
Oh, sorry! Accidents happen!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:43.590
Fatass.

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:46.640
Who you callin' a fatass?!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:55.040
You done crossed the line,
you homewrecker!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.200
Third wheel!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:58.700
Numskull!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:02.320
S-So this is the mud wrestling beloved of men nationwide!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.280
Catfight!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:06.990
I'm overcome with burning emotion!

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.950
More to the point...

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.960
You're ruining the paddy!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.240
Cut it out!

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:13.410
Behave yourselves!

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:16.620
You stay out of this!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.590
We're sorry!

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:48.580
You put up a good fight.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.700
Likewise.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:59.810
<i>And so friendship began to sorta
blossom between the two, maybe.</i>

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:04.610
<i>As for the paddy, I planted it
the next day with a rice transplanter.</i>

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:06.050
<i>Who wrote this shit?</i>

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:39.300
"The Smile You Showed Me".
